<section class="g-wrap gpolicy" style="padding:64px 24px 80px;max-width:820px;">
  <h1 class="g-h2" style="margin-bottom:8px;">{{ page.title | default: 'Policy' }}</h1>
  <div class="gpolicy-updated">Gene Streetwear</div>
  <div class="gpolicy-body">
    {%- case page.handle -%}
    {%- when 'refund-policy' -%}
      <p>We have a 30-day return policy. You have 30 days from the day you receive your order to request a return.</p>
      <h3>Eligibility</h3>
      <p>To be eligible for a return, your item must be:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>In the same condition as you received it</li>
        <li>Unworn, unwashed, and unused</li>
        <li>With all original tags attached</li>
        <li>In its original packaging</li>
        <li>Accompanied by the receipt or proof of purchase</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>How to start a return</h3>
      <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:support@genestreetwear.com">support@genestreetwear.com</a> with your order number and the reason for return. Our team replies within 24 hours with the return address and instructions.</p>
      <p>Please don't send the item back before we confirm the return — packages sent without prior approval cannot be processed.</p>
      <p>Once we receive and inspect your return, we'll notify you by email. If approved, your refund is issued to your original payment method within 10 business days.</p>
      <h3>Damages and issues</h3>
      <p>Inspect your order as soon as it arrives. If your item is defective, damaged, or wrong, contact us within 7 days at support@genestreetwear.com with photos. We'll make it right — full refund or free replacement, your choice.</p>
      <h3>Non-returnable items</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Items marked FINAL SALE (including seasonal sale items)</li>
        <li>Gift cards</li>
        <li>Items returned more than 30 days after delivery</li>
        <li>Items showing signs of wear, washing, or missing tags</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Exchanges</h3>
      <p>The fastest way to get the size or item you want: request a return for the original item, then place a new order for the replacement.</p>
      <h3>EU customers — 14-day cooling-off period</h3>
      <p>If your order ships to the European Union, you may cancel or return your order within 14 days of receiving it, for any reason. The item must be in original, unworn condition with all tags attached.</p>
      <h3>Refunds</h3>
      <p>Once approved, we refund the original payment method within 10 business days. Shipping costs are non-refundable unless the return is due to our error.</p>

    {%- when 'shipping-policy' -%}
      <p>We ship worldwide from our fulfillment center. Every order is processed and packed with care.</p>
      <h3>Processing time</h3>
      <p>Orders are processed within 1–3 business days after payment is confirmed. You'll receive a confirmation email with tracking once your order ships. Orders placed on weekends or holidays are processed the next business day.</p>
      <h3>Shipping rates &amp; delivery times</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Worldwide — $13 USD — 5–15 business days</li>
        <li>Free shipping on orders over $88 — standard delivery</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Delivery times are estimates and start from the day your order ships, not the day you place it.</p>
      <h3>Tracking your order</h3>
      <p>Once your order ships, you'll receive a tracking number by email. If you don't see a confirmation within 3 business days, check your spam folder or contact support@genestreetwear.com.</p>
      <h3>Customs, duties &amp; taxes</h3>
      <p>For international orders outside the US, your country may apply customs fees, import duties, or VAT. These charges are the buyer's responsibility and aren't included in the product or shipping price.</p>
      <h3>Delays</h3>
      <p>Occasional delays may happen due to customs, weather, carrier disruptions, or high-volume periods. If your order takes longer than expected, contact us and we'll investigate immediately.</p>
      <h3>Lost or stolen packages</h3>
      <p>If tracking shows delivered but you didn't receive it, check with neighbors and your local post office, wait 48 hours, then contact us.</p>

    {%- when 'privacy-policy' -%}
      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Gene Streetwear ("we", "us", "our") collects, uses, and protects your personal information when you visit our store or place an order.</p>
      <h3>Information we collect</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Order information:</strong> name, shipping and billing address, email, phone number</li>
        <li><strong>Payment information:</strong> processed securely by our payment providers (we don't store full card details)</li>
        <li><strong>Browsing information:</strong> IP address, browser type, pages visited — via cookies and analytics</li>
        <li><strong>Communications:</strong> any messages you send us</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>How we use your information</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Process and ship your orders</li>
        <li>Send order confirmations and shipping updates</li>
        <li>Respond to customer service inquiries</li>
        <li>Send marketing emails (only if you opt in)</li>
        <li>Improve our website and prevent fraud</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Sharing your information</h3>
      <p>We share data only with parties who help us run the store (Shopify, payment processors, shipping carriers, email and analytics providers). <strong>We do not sell your personal information.</strong></p>
      <h3>Cookies</h3>
      <p>Our website uses cookies to remember your cart, analyze traffic, and improve your experience. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, but some features may not work properly.</p>
      <h3>Your rights (GDPR — EU customers)</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
        <li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Object to processing or request data portability</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, email support@genestreetwear.com.</p>
      <h3>Security</h3>
      <p>We protect your information with industry-standard security measures, including SSL encryption at checkout.</p>
      <h3>Children's privacy</h3>
      <p>Our website is not intended for children under 13. We don't knowingly collect personal data from minors.</p>
      <p><em>Last updated: April 2026</em></p>

    {%- when 'terms-of-service' -%}
      <p>By accessing and using this website, you agree to these Terms of Service. Please read them carefully.</p>
      <h3>General</h3>
      <p>We reserve the right to refuse service, cancel orders, or limit quantities at our discretion. Prices and product availability are subject to change without notice.</p>
      <h3>Orders &amp; payment</h3>
      <p>By placing an order you confirm the information provided is accurate. Payment is processed securely at checkout. An order is confirmed once payment is received.</p>
      <h3>Products</h3>
      <p>We do our best to display product colors and details accurately, but can't guarantee your screen shows them perfectly. Every drop is limited — once sold out, items may not restock.</p>
      <h3>Intellectual property</h3>
      <p>All content on this site (logos, images, text, designs) is the property of Gene Streetwear and may not be used without permission.</p>
      <h3>Limitation of liability</h3>
      <p>To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from the use of our products or website.</p>
      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <p>Questions about these terms? Email support@genestreetwear.com.</p>

    {%- when 'contact', 'contact-information' -%}
      <p>Questions, order help, or returns? We're here for you.</p>
      <h3>Email</h3>
      <p><a href="mailto:support@genestreetwear.com">support@genestreetwear.com</a> — we reply within 24 hours.</p>
      <h3>Social</h3>
      <p>DM us on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/genestreetwear" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a> or <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@genestreetwear" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TikTok</a>.</p>
      <h3>Returns</h3>
      <p>Start a return by emailing your order number to support@genestreetwear.com. See our Refund Policy for details.</p>

    {%- else -%}
      {{ page.content }}
    {%- endcase -%}
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.gpolicy-updated { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom:32px; }
.gpolicy-body { font-size:15px; line-height:1.72; color:var(--ink-soft); }
.gpolicy-body h3 { font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); margin:30px 0 10px; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
.gpolicy-body p { margin:0 0 14px; }
.gpolicy-body ul { margin:0 0 16px; padding-left:20px; }
.gpolicy-body li { margin:0 0 7px; }
.gpolicy-body a { color:var(--ink); }
</style>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "GENE — Policy",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
